  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（アンティーカのみんなでカラオケか……）",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "仲が良いのは\r\nいいことだな",
    "nextLabel": "1007001001311"
  },
  {
    "select": "次は\r\n観客に向けて歌おう",
    "nextLabel": "1007001001312"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "次のレッスン\r\n楽しみにしてるぞ",
    "nextLabel": "1007001001313"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001001310030,
    "label": "1007001001311",
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "当然。一緒に活動してるしね",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/100700100131/1007001001310030"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001001310040,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "でもこの間は新発見もあってさ。まだ知らないこともあるし\r\nもっとみんなのこと知りたいなって",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/100700100131/1007001001310040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（よし、楽しく話せたな）",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001001310050,
    "label": "1007001001312",
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "そうだね！　次は満員御礼のステージで！\r\nあー、ライブで歌うの楽しみだなぁ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/100700100131/1007001001310050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001001310060,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "ちゃんとお仕事取ってきてね？\r\nファイト、プロデューサー！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/100700100131/1007001001310060"
  },
  {
